Package: lyricsr
Title: Search Genius.com for Songs, Artists, Albums, and Lyrics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Brian", "Walsh", email = "bwalsh5@elon.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R package that searches the public Genius.com API for songs, artists, and albums, and extracts lyrics
    from song pages. Results are returned as tibbles, lyrics are cached on
    disk so each page is only downloaded once, requests are rate limited and
    retried, and lyrics extraction falls back to the page's embedded JSON if
    the HTML layout changes. Optionally falls back to the LRCLIB lyrics
    database when Genius has no lyrics. Inspired by the lyricsgenius package for python:
    <https://github.com/johnwmillr/LyricsGenius>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
